### реєстрація
POST http://localhost:5000/users HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Artem",
  "email": "artem@gmail.com",
  "password": "qwerty123"
}

### логін
POST http://localhost:5000/users/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "artem@gmail.com",
  "password": "qwerty123"
}

### get
GET http://localhost:5000/users/21 HTTP/1.1

### update
PATCH http://localhost:5000/users/21 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Artem update",
  "email": "artem@gmail.com"
}

### change pass
PATCH http://localhost:5000/users/21/password HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "qwerty123",
  "newPassword": "qwerty111"
}

